    {
      "cn_text": "这些新形式起初主要由学者创作并由业余爱好者演出,但在英国以及西欧各地,职业演员阶层的兴起正使戏剧有走向大众化的趋势,无论其是新是旧、是古典还是中世纪、是文学性的还是闹剧性的。",
      "en_text": "These new forms were at first mainly written by scholars and performed by amateurs, but in England, as everywhere else in western Europe, the growth of a class of professional actors was threatening to make the drama popular, whether it should be new or old, classical or medieval, literary or farcical.",
      "id": 2018013237,
      "order_seq": "content_1_3",
      "task_id": 201801007,
