    {
      "cn_text": "宫廷、学校、业余爱好者组织以及巡回演员都在竞相满足人们对戏剧娱乐的广泛需求;而任何一个上过文法学校的男孩都不可能不知道,戏剧是一种文学形式,它曾为希腊和罗马带来荣耀,也可能为英国带来荣誉。",
      "en_text": "Court, school, organizations of amateurs, and the traveling actors were all rivals in supplying a widespread desire for dramatic entertainment; and no boy who went to a grammar school could be ignorant that the drama was a form of literature which gave glory to Greece and Rome and might yet bring honor to England.",
      "id": 2018013238,
      "order_seq": "content_1_4",
      "task_id": 201801007,
