    {
      "cn_text": "追求文学成就的戏剧是为学校或宫廷创作的,或是为圣保罗教堂和皇家礼拜堂的唱诗班男孩创作的,不过这些男孩既在宫廷也在公众场合演出戏剧。",
      "en_text": "Plays aiming at literary distinction were written for schools or court, or for the choir boys of St. Paul’s and the royal chapel, who, however, gave plays in public as well as at court.",
