    {
      "cn_text": "到莎士比亚二十五岁时,黎里、皮尔和格林已创作出既流行又具文学性的喜剧;基德写就了一部令剧场爆满的悲剧;而马洛则将诗歌和天才带到了大众舞台并获得成功——自欧里庇得斯去世后,诗歌和天才就不曾在舞台上扮演任何角色。",
      "en_text": "By the time that Shakespeare was twenty-five, Lyly, Peele, and Greene had made comedies that were at once popular and literary; Kyd had written a tragedy that crowded the pit; and Marlowe had brought poetry and genius to triumph on the common stage — where they had played no part since the death of Euripides.",
      "id": 2018013244,
      "order_seq": "content_2_6",
