    {
      "cn_text": "今天我们既惊叹于当时创作的戏剧数量之巨,也惊叹于同时期为这座仅有二十万居民的伦敦城创作的剧作家人数之众。",
      "en_text": "We are amazed today at the mere number of plays produced, as well as by the number of dramatists writing at the same time for this London of two hundred thousand inhabitants.",
